'''Peach 'n Banana''' (モモとバナナ, ''Momo to Banana'', '''Peach and Banana''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
Unit Speed UP (Sm): Cats' movement speed increases by 10%.

